          "issue": "The draft adopts a causal reading of ὅτι with μὴ negating γέγονεν, but does not disclose the material alternative: ὅτι μὴ can introduce an exception. That alternative changes the relationship between the astrologers’ healing claims and past precedent. The causal rendering is contextually defensible, particularly beside the following assertion that such correction never occurred through natal destiny; the unresolved attachment nevertheless needs disclosure. This is an interpretive issue, not evidence of defective transcription.",
